; The Brigadier's Nosorog (scripts\shelter_brigadier.script): the mercenaries' Nosorog, every upgrade installed, five
; artefact containers that let none of their radiation through (the engine's artefact_radiation_shield), a helmet
; module with a light, Oracle night vision, thermal vision and an anomaly visor. Drops off the Brigadier's body with
; his M4 (below).
